        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GUNS&amp;SODAS</strong> is a fast-paced arcade rogue-action game where explosive sodas and relentless gunfire mix into a high-octane experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the <strong>Five Primal Sodas</strong>, the base ingredients of every drink ever made, have been stolen, only you, the Chosen Can Hero, can bring them back. Get ready to face waves of armed enemies, dynamic environments, and unleash the full power of the legendary <strong>Vending Machines</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE 5 PRIMORDIAL DRINKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the Primordial Drinks to unlock permanent effects for future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/49ca372fa7d2d439656db97e552706af.avif?t=1761028687\" width=781 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/ce89cd20ce8b835cc4de3b20b95ee205.avif?t=1761028687\" width=781 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/19a493d20d4f305a9ea755052133b064.avif?t=1761028687\" width=781 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/f31951e1d5c6f6e806a7ee34d65f7e70.avif?t=1761028687\" width=781 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/b12d8f84163cd2ea826efbcf18577195.avif?t=1761028687\" width=781 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Stylish, high-speed arcade action:</strong> Dash, shoot, and chain combos in a fast and fluid combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Rogue-lite mechanics: </strong>Start each run from scratch, but as your skills improve, you’ll earn higher scores to unlock <strong>better gear and alternate paths</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Super Dash: </strong>Dodge enemy fire with high-speed acrobatic moves using the side mouse buttons (or by quickly pressing the left and right mouse buttons in sequence), or by pressing L3 on the gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Vending Machines as allies:</strong> Activate and upgrade VMs to gain rear cover. Some drop powerful <strong>gadgets</strong> that trigger your <strong>Super Shot</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Tons of guns: </strong>Discover a wild arsenal of pistols, each with its own unique mechanics and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Combo system:</strong> Chain kills to boost efficiency and increase your final score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GUNS&amp;SODAS</strong> is a fast-paced arcade rogue-action game where explosive sodas and relentless gunfire mix into a high-octane experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the <strong>Five Primal Sodas</strong>, the base ingredients of every drink ever made, have been stolen, only you, the Chosen Can Hero, can bring them back. Get ready to face waves of armed enemies, dynamic environments, and unleash the full power of the legendary <strong>Vending Machines</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE 5 PRIMORDIAL DRINKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the Primordial Drinks to unlock permanent effects for future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/49ca372fa7d2d439656db97e552706af.avif?t=1761028687\" width=781 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/ce89cd20ce8b835cc4de3b20b95ee205.avif?t=1761028687\" width=781 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/19a493d20d4f305a9ea755052133b064.avif?t=1761028687\" width=781 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/f31951e1d5c6f6e806a7ee34d65f7e70.avif?t=1761028687\" width=781 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/b12d8f84163cd2ea826efbcf18577195.avif?t=1761028687\" width=781 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Stylish, high-speed arcade action:</strong> Dash, shoot, and chain combos in a fast and fluid combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Rogue-lite mechanics: </strong>Start each run from scratch, but as your skills improve, you’ll earn higher scores to unlock <strong>better gear and alternate paths</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Super Dash: </strong>Dodge enemy fire with high-speed acrobatic moves using the side mouse buttons (or by quickly pressing the left and right mouse buttons in sequence), or by pressing L3 on the gamepad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Vending Machines as allies:</strong> Activate and upgrade VMs to gain rear cover. Some drop powerful <strong>gadgets</strong> that trigger your <strong>Super Shot</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Tons of guns: </strong>Discover a wild arsenal of pistols, each with its own unique mechanics and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Combo system:</strong> Chain kills to boost efficiency and increase your final score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
